  "excludedPathsReason": "All 27 /genre/{id}/artists?limit=100 endpoints returned the identical ordered 50 artist IDs, including unrelated global pop artists for Jazz/Classical/Asian Music. All inferred genre tags were discarded.",
  "limitations": [
    "Deduplicated by Deezer track ID only; remasters/live versions/compilations can represent the same composition.",
    "artistGenres is intentionally empty for every record because public genre-to-artist responses were found unreliable in this run.",
    "Curated discovery categories describe the researcher's search routes, not verified artist/track/album genre labels; they appear only in provenance/statistics.",
    "Artist top endpoints favor popular recordings. This is a bounded multi-artist catalog snapshot, not the global music catalog or a representative random sample.",
    "popularity is raw Deezer rank and is not a quality/personal-preference score.",
    "previewAvailable is URL presence at collection time. Audio was never downloaded; preview URLs were stripped from stored response bodies and final records.",
    "No lyrics, inferred listening descriptors, synthetic recommendations, account access, or paid model calls were used.",
    "Official track URL is supplied by the API or constructed from its stable provider ID when omitted by top endpoint.",
    "Three potentially in-flight interrupted requests are included conservatively in the request upper bound."
